<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings cuts Vendex EPS estimates, repeats Buy.</title>
<headline>ING Barings cuts Vendex EPS estimates, repeats Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 12 research.</p>
<p>Company------------Sector--------Price---Broker------</p>
<p>Vendex		 Retail	  61.90   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT:Buy reiterated. EPS estimates downgraded following H1 results. Recommendation based on positive outlook for retailing, notably non-food. Given broad range of formats ING Barings feels Vendex best player in this respect and views valuation of Vendex still moderate at 1997 PER of 10.8 percent.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	4.26		  14.5    1.50</p>
<p>    1996		   5.15     5.25     12.0    1.80</p>
<p>    1997		   5.73     5.85     10.8    2.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
</text>
